  "notes": "{届|とど}け{出|で}る is used for formal notifications to authorities or organizations.\n\nCOMMON OBJECTS:\n- ⟦{転居届|てんきょとどけ}→転居届：10284_tenkyotodoke⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{届|とど}け{出|で}る: to file a change of address\n- ⟦{婚姻届|こんいんとどけ}→婚姻届：22413_konintodoke⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{届|とど}け{出|で}る: to file a marriage registration\n- ⟦{紛失届|ふんしつとどけ}→紛失届：20685_funshitsutodoke⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{届|とど}け{出|で}る: to file a loss report\n- ⟦{退職届|たいしょくとどけ}→退職届：15695_taishokutodoke⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{届|とど}け{出|で}る: to submit a resignation\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\nThis is a compound verb combining ⟦{届|とど}ける→届ける：01248_todokeru⟧ (to deliver) and ⟦{出|で}る→出る：00513_deru⟧ (to come out/submit).",
